{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And Adah bore</b> — regarding the children of Jacob, when tracing their lineage he says \"the sons of Leah,\" \"the sons of Rachel,\" and so for all of them, because they are the building of the world and therefore they are called \"sons.\" But the children of Esau are not called \"sons\" but rather \"ולדות\" (offspring), like \"ולד בהמה\" (the young of an animal)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:45.217588623Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}